      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Repository plugin defaults and enterprise-managed plugin controls are now generally available in VS Code, Copilot CLI, and the GitHub Copilot app.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Trusted repositories can install and enable default plugins for contributors.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Enterprises can require plugins, block plugins, and restrict installation to approved marketplaces.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As a repository maintainer, you can define a plugin marketplace and default plugins so contributors don&rsquo;t have to repeat setup for each project.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Contributors can turn off repository defaults where policy permits.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As an enterprise administrator, you can supply approved marketplaces and require or block plugins through managed settings.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Required plugins are automatically installed and enabled, and users can&rsquo;t disable them.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Managed settings take precedence over repository and personal choices.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Repository defaults are available to individual Copilot users and users with Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Managed controls are available on GitHub Enterprise Cloud for users with Copilot Business or Copilot Enterprise licenses issued by the enterprise or one of its organizations.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-repository-plugin-defaults-and-enterprise-plugin-controls-generally-available",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:33:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:42:55.228Z"
      },
      {
